[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_04_0010","text":"──羽那是，18颗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_04_0020","text":"阳希是，17颗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_04_0030","text":"────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_04_0040","text":"咸咸的香香的，\n这样吃着也很好吃呢，节分的豆子……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_04_0050","text":"是啊\n感觉能吃好多"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_04_0060","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_04_0070","text":"──啊，路加也吃吗？\n豆子还有很多哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_04_0080","text":"嗯……20颗……\n对吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_04_0090","text":"……不要"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32700500_04_0100","text":"诶？\n明明很好吃的说——"}]
